Whilst we wait for confirmation, you could use rewrites as a work-around if you are just trying to obtain a `/index` route.

```
const nextConfig: NextConfig = {
  /* other config options ... */
  async rewrites() {
    return [
      {
        source: "/index",
        destination: "/index_page",
      },
    ];
  },
};
```
