@salazarm this was part of the Next.js 16 release described in the blog notes, specifically the routing section [here](https://nextjs.org/blog/next-16#enhanced-routing-and-navigation). The relevant section is:
> Trade-off: You may see more individual prefetch requests, but with much lower total transfer sizes. We believe this is the right trade-off for nearly all applications. If the increased request count causes issues, please let us know. We're working on additional optimizations to inline data chunks more efficiently.

We'll likely expose some configuration to customize this further, but wanting to clarify that the increase in prefetches is expected at the moment when using Next 16.

To prevent incorrect RSC/Router caching, it internally sets Vary headers like RSC, Next-Router-State-Tree, Next-Url. This internal setting is done in the final response stage and effectively overrides the Vary value you set in the middleware. This behavior has been observed in older issues as well.



Move Vary configuration from middleware to Route Handler / API Route

If possible, set the Vary header in a place where you have full control over the final response (e.g., inside app/**/route.ts or API route handlers). At that stage, Next.js is less likely to override it.



import { NextResponse } from 'next/server';

export async function GET() {
  const res = new NextResponse('OK');
  const existing = res.headers.get('Vary');
  res.headers.set('Vary', [existing, 'Accept-Language'].filter(Boolean).join(', '));

  res.headers.set('Cache-Control', 's-maxage=600, stale-while-revalidate=60');
  return res;
}


-----------------------------




If the variant is always static: use next.config.js > headers()

For specific routes that should always include a Vary header, you can define it in next.config.js (this runs before middleware). Note: this approach is not dynamic.


module.exports = {
  async headers() {
    return [
      {
        source: '/:path*',
        headers: [
          { key: 'Vary', value: 'Accept-Language' },
          { key: 'Cache-Control', value: 's-maxage=600, stale-while-revalidate=60' },
        ],
      },
    ]
  },
}

