I was able to extract this using an interceptor that I had put in in the layout.tsx file at the very top like this:

```js
const originalSort = Array.prototype.sort;
Array.prototype.sort = function (...args) {
  try {
    return originalSort.apply(this, args);
  } catch (e) {
    console.error('=== SORT CRASH STACK ===', new Error().stack);
    return originalSort.apply([...this], args); // don't crash, just log
  }
};
```

